    "body": "## Summary\n\nCloses ADR-035 by flipping status to Implemented, adding an Implementation section that records the split delivery honestly, adding Post-ADR-035 notes to ADR-031 and ADR-034, and updating CHANGELOG. **Documentation only — no code changes.**\n\n## Split delivery, recorded honestly\n\n### What fully landed (header)\n\n| Element | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Wordmark | 248×0 | **248×39** |\n| Tagline | 248×0 (paint-skip workaround) | **248×19 (unhidden)** |\n| Header height | ~50px | **~94px** |\n| Article intro y | 145 | ~189 (+44) |\n\n**Zero workarounds left in `paint.cpp`** — ADR-034's tagline skip removed.\n\n### What partially landed (thumbnails)\n\nHTML5 logo and categories diagram have real heights in the tree (250×250, 250×177) but don't propagate down. Root cause: thumbnails are `<img>` inside `<figure class=\"thumb\">` set to `float: right`. Per ADR-031's float v1, floated content doesn't advance parent `cursor_y`. **Correct float v1 behavior.** ADR-036 (layout-integrated float) fixes.\n\n### What's still failing (JPEG)\n\nTBL photo (926×0) has JPEG src. Cairo PNG decode rejects it. Needs `libjpeg-turbo` (deferred since ADR-034).\n\n## Three honest findings preserved\n\n1. **Thumbnail propagation through float v1** — correct behavior, ADR-036 fixes\n2. **Navbox/sidebar variant overlap** (pre-existing, not caused by ADR-035) — own follow-up cycle\n3. **JPEG decode dependency** — deferred since ADR-034\n\n## What the Implementation section records\n\n- Split delivery (header clean, thumbnails partial, JPEG deferred)\n- Measured delta table for all 8 `<img>` elements\n- Three findings with root causes\n- Performance cost honestly stated: 5.0→5.3-5.8s cold cache, cached after\n- Resolution status against ADR-034's four limitations: 2 resolved, 2 unchanged\n\n## Post-ADR-035 notes\n\n- **ADR-031 (float)**: thumbnail-propagation limitation surfaced by ADR-035. Explains why float v1 is correct but produces unexpected article flow with large images. ADR-036 resolves.\n- **ADR-034**: two of its four limitations resolved (image layout space; tagline overlap). Two unchanged (SVG `<text>`, `calc()` for search icon). Three new findings recorded (thumbnail propagation, navbox, JPEG).\n\n## What changed\n\n- `docs/decisions/035-img-layout.md` — Status: Accepted → **Implemented**; Implementation section (106 lines)\n- `docs/decisions/031-float-layout.md` — Post-ADR-035 note\n- `docs/decisions/034-img-absolute.md` — Post-ADR-035 note\n- `CHANGELOG.md` — new `### Added` entry for ADR-035\n\n## What didn't change\n\n- Zero code changes\n- Test count: 425 / 1741\n- Full suite green\n- CI green (PR and post-merge on #185)\n\n## The natural next cycle\n\n**ADR-036 (layout-integrated float)**: floated children contribute parent height when only-child; `clear` forces content below. Fixes below-fold thumbnail propagation. ~150-200 lines.\n\n**Or** small follow-ups, each own ADR:\n- Navbox/sidebar hide (identify class token, add to viewport_css)\n- `calc()` evaluation (search icon 2×2 → correct)\n- JPEG decode (`libjpeg-turbo` dependency)\n- `max-width` (footer SVGs and width-constrained containers)\n\nRefs #184 #185\n",
